  "name": "handoff-list",
  "description": "Use when the user wants to see which handoffs are still open for a repo. Triggered by /handoff-list, \"有哪些 handoff\", \"還有什麼沒做完\", \"list handoffs\", or any request to review the handoff todo list. Prints ID, date, a one-line task summary and the next-step count for each open handoff; accepts --repo <path>. Read-only — it never archives, moves or deletes, and never guesses whether a handoff is finished.",
